---
import MainLayout from '@/layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="E5 Wheels - Forged Process">
  <div class="w-full bg-white">
    <!-- Hero Video Section 1 -->
    <section class="relative h-[400px] md:h-[799px] w-full">
      <img
        src="/assets/images/process/forged/d58a7e9630e8b54bac2641294335708365a28d50.webp"
        alt="E5 Factory"
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </section>

    <!-- The Forging Process Section -->
    <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-[1583px] mx-auto px-6">
        <!-- Title -->
        <h1 class="text-e5-red text-[32px] md:text-[64px] font-franklin-book tracking-[6.4px] md:tracking-[12.8px] uppercase mb-3 md:mb-4 px-6 md:px-12">
          THE FORGING PROCESS
        </h1>

        <!-- Subtitle -->
        <p class="text-[16px] md:text-[24px] font-franklin-book text-black tracking-[3.2px] md:tracking-[4.8px] uppercase mb-3 md:mb-4 px-6 md:px-12">
          Forged in the USA. Engineered Without Compromise.
        </p>

        <!-- USA Flag -->
        <div class="px-6 md:px-12 mb-8 md:mb-12">
          <img
            src="/assets/images/process/forged/74e97b24bbd8f0fa93b10ef755682a46c52738c9.webp"
            alt="Made in USA"
            class="h-[24px] md:h-[32px] w-[45px] md:w-[60px]"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Description -->
        <p class="text-black/70 text-[18px] md:text-[32px] leading-[22px] md:leading-[35px] max-w-full md:max-w-[1538px] mb-8 md:mb-16 px-6 md:px-12">
          Every E5 Forged wheel begins with purpose. Designed exclusively for Corvette platforms, our forged wheels are engineered and manufactured in the United States to meet the extreme demands of performance, precision, and strength. From aerospace-grade material selection to final finishing, each step is executed with intention—eliminating excess, reinforcing structure, and delivering uncompromising performance for the C8 Z06, ZR1, and E-Ray.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Materials Section -->
    <section class="relative h-[350px] md:h-[568px] w-full">
      <div class="absolute inset-0">
        <img
          src="/assets/images/process/forged/95c0a7034a42aefe8f6b81d8a1954dc67e42b28c.webp"
          alt="Materials"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/46"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative h-full flex items-center">
        <div class="max-w-[1583px] mx-auto px-6 w-full">
          <div class="max-w-full md:max-w-[950px] px-6 md:px-12">
            <h2 class="text-white text-[32px] md:text-[64px] font-franklin-book tracking-[6.4px] md:tracking-[12.8px] uppercase mb-4 md:mb-8">
              MATERIALS
            </h2>
            <p class="text-white/70 text-[16px] md:text-[32px] leading-[20px] md:leading-[35px]">
              The process begins with 6061 aerospace-grade aluminum billet, selected for uniform grain structure, tensile strength, and fatigue resistance—forming the structural foundation for high-pressure forging.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Forging Section -->
    <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-[1583px] mx-auto px-6">
        <!-- Title -->
        <h2 class="text-e5-red text-[32px] md:text-[64px] font-franklin-book tracking-[6.4px] md:tracking-[12.8px] uppercase mb-8 md:mb-12 px-6 md:px-12">
          FORGING
        </h2>

        <!-- Description -->
        <p class="text-black/70 text-[18px] md:text-[32px] leading-[22px] md:leading-[35px] max-w-full md:max-w-[1538px] mb-8 md:mb-16 px-6 md:px-12">
          Through high-pressure forging, the aluminum is compressed under immense force to refine and realign its internal grain structure. This critical step increases material density, enhances fatigue resistance, and significantly improves impact strength compared to cast or flow-formed alternatives. The result is a forging with superior structural integrity at its core—engineered to handle both street and track demands.
        </p>

        <!-- Three Images -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8 md:mb-12">
          <div>
            <img
              src="/assets/images/process/forged/f0f3e57be69ac17bdf5d0b88a9acbb4dd11c959e.webp"
              alt="Forging Process 1"
              class="w-full h-[250px] md:h-[360px] object-cover mb-3 md:mb-4"
            />
            <p class="text-black/75 text-[12px] md:text-[16px] tracking-[2.4px] md:tracking-[3.2px] uppercase leading-[16px] md:leading-[20px] font-franklin-book">
              A 6061 aluminum forging heated to forging temperature, ready for high-pressure compression and grain refinement.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <img
              src="/assets/images/process/forged/809caca77164233a698d905f1d587df976aea6e3.webp"
              alt="Forging Process 2"
              class="w-full h-[250px] md:h-[360px] object-cover mb-3 md:mb-4"
            />
            <p class="text-black/75 text-[12px] md:text-[16px] tracking-[2.4px] md:tracking-[3.2px] uppercase leading-[16px] md:leading-[20px] font-franklin-book">
              A forged aluminum wheel blank for the C8 Z06, precision-machined to its final dimensions and structural profile.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <img
              src="/assets/images/process/forged/797d5893d4a0bae48a4ccb031cafc436db1200ca.webp"
              alt="Forging Process 3"
              class="w-full h-[250px] md:h-[360px] object-cover mb-3 md:mb-4"
            />
            <p class="text-black/75 text-[12px] md:text-[16px] tracking-[2.4px] md:tracking-[3.2px] uppercase leading-[16px] md:leading-[20px] font-franklin-book">
              A precision measuring probe rotates around the wheel to verify runout, concentricity, and dimensional accuracy, ensuring exact tolerances are met across the entire profile.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hero Video Section 2 -->
    <section class="relative h-[400px] md:h-[799px] w-full">
      <img
        src="/assets/images/process/forged/d58a7e9630e8b54bac2641294335708365a28d50.webp"
        alt="Factory Machining"
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center">
        <div class="max-w-[1583px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-6 w-full">
          <h2 class="text-white text-[24px] md:text-[48px] font-franklin-book tracking-[4.8px] md:tracking-[9.6px] uppercase leading-[28px] md:leading-[48px] max-w-[500px] md:max-w-[915px]">
            FACTORY CLIPS OF THE MACHINING, TOOLS, AND THE DRILL POV. SHOW MACHINES AND FORGINGS
          </h2>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Machining Section -->
    <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-[1583px] mx-auto px-6">
        <!-- Title -->
        <h2 class="text-e5-red text-[32px] md:text-[64px] font-franklin-book tracking-[6.4px] md:tracking-[12.8px] uppercase mb-8 md:mb-12 px-6 md:px-12">
          MACHINING
        </h2>

        <!-- Description -->
        <p class="text-black/70 text-[18px] md:text-[32px] leading-[22px] md:leading-[35px] max-w-full md:max-w-[1538px] mb-8 md:mb-16 px-6 md:px-12">
          Once forged, each wheel is precision-machined in California using advanced 5-axis CNC equipment. Material is removed strategically and with purpose, allowing us to reduce rotational mass while preserving strength in high-load areas such as the hub, spokes, and barrel transition zones. Every cut is engineered to improve stiffness, response, and balance without sacrificing durability.
        </p>

        <!-- Side by Side Content -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center">
          <!-- Placeholder Image -->
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 px-6 md:px-12">
            <div class="bg-gray-300 h-[300px] md:h-[471px] flex items-center justify-center">
              <p class="text-black text-[20px] md:text-[40px] font-franklin-book tracking-[4px] md:tracking-[8px] uppercase leading-[24px] md:leading-[40px] text-center max-w-[400px] md:max-w-[635px] px-6 md:px-12">
                need screen grab of 5axis machine from factory video
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- E5 Forged Logo and Text -->
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 px-6 md:px-12">
            <img
              src="/assets/images/process/forged/02d80e5501d4b44b3e61daf67192b4fe23242b09.webp"
              alt="E5 Forged"
              class="h-[28px] md:h-[35px] mb-6 md:mb-8"
            />
            <p class="text-black text-[24px] md:text-[40px] font-franklin-book tracking-[4.8px] md:tracking-[8px] uppercase leading-[28px] md:leading-[40px]">
              exclusively for corvettes.
              <br /><br />
              Forged in California, usa.
            </p>
            <img
              src="/assets/images/process/forged/74e97b24bbd8f0fa93b10ef755682a46c52738c9.webp"
              alt="Made in USA"
              class="h-[40px] md:h-[54px] w-[76px] md:w-[103px] mt-4 md:mt-6"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Finishing Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative h-[350px] md:h-[548px] w-full">
      <div class="absolute inset-0">
        <img
          src="/assets/images/process/forged/d354d8ab5082f9427e0deb5da0017f26e9d8f3c8.webp"
          alt="Finishing"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/60"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative h-full flex items-center">
        <div class="max-w-[1583px] mx-auto px-6 w-full">
          <div class="max-w-full md:max-w-[950px] px-6 md:px-12">
            <h2 class="text-white text-[32px] md:text-[64px] font-franklin-book tracking-[6.4px] md:tracking-[12.8px] uppercase mb-4 md:mb-8">
              FINISHING
            </h2>
            <p class="text-white/70 text-[16px] md:text-[32px] leading-[20px] md:leading-[35px]">
              Final refinement is completed by hand, ensuring perfect symmetry, crisp edges, and visual clarity across all surfaces. Each wheel then receives a premium finish, applied and inspected to meet strict standards for corrosion resistance, longevity, and visual consistency.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Before/After Section -->
    <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-[1583px] mx-auto px-6">
        <!-- Before -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center mb-12 md:mb-16 py-6 md:py-8">
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 px-6 md:px-12">
            <img
              src="/assets/images/process/forged/b9590fdbbe1a9e6203dbf8fe826d0dafe9f7baba.webp"
              alt="Before Finishing"
              class="w-full h-[300px] md:h-[471px] object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 px-6 md:px-12">
            <h3 class="text-e5-red/70 text-[24px] md:text-[32px] leading-[28px] md:leading-[35px] mb-4 md:mb-6">
              BEFORE
            </h3>
            <p class="text-black/70 text-[18px] md:text-[32px] leading-[22px] md:leading-[35px]">
              Precision machining leaves visible tool paths along each spoke, which are carefully brushed and refined to achieve a smooth, uniform surface before finishing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- After -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center py-6 md:py-8">
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 px-6 md:px-12">
            <img
              src="/assets/images/process/forged/bb6950e1bfd656ac155d1f7e1c229877ded3a542.webp"
              alt="After Finishing"
              class="w-full h-[300px] md:h-[471px] object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 px-6 md:px-12">
            <h3 class="text-e5-red/70 text-[24px] md:text-[32px] leading-[28px] md:leading-[35px] mb-4 md:mb-6">
              AFTER
            </h3>
            <p class="text-black/70 text-[18px] md:text-[32px] leading-[22px] md:leading-[35px]">
              After brushing, the surface is clear coated to lock in the finish while enhancing depth, clarity, and long-term protection.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Engineering Gallery Section -->
    <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-[1583px] mx-auto px-6">
        <!-- Title -->
        <h2 class="text-e5-red text-[32px] md:text-[48px] font-franklin-book tracking-[6.4px] md:tracking-[9.6px] uppercase mb-3 md:mb-4 px-6 md:px-12">
          ENGINEERING GALLERY
        </h2>

        <!-- Description -->
        <p class="text-black/70 text-[16px] md:text-[24px] leading-[22px] md:leading-[30px] max-w-full md:max-w-[1276px] mb-8 md:mb-12 px-6 md:px-12">
          Explore our gallery highlighting the craftsmanship and processes behind our Form Forged Series and E5 Forged lineup.
        </p>

        <!-- Gallery Images -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8 md:mb-12">
          <img
            src="/assets/images/process/forged/e19678cc4eb2a07b29d02cf3a102aae01e8821f0.webp"
            alt="Gallery 1"
            class="w-full h-[300px] md:h-[530px] object-cover"
          />
          <img
            src="/assets/images/process/forged/cdbe8c6e371de88df054fe877f0bc9f521d0281f.webp"
            alt="Gallery 2"
            class="w-full h-[300px] md:h-[531px] object-cover"
          />
          <img
            src="/assets/images/process/forged/79cabf09ed608910ec2929d1b9569d5bc1322992.webp"
            alt="Gallery 3"
            class="w-full h-[300px] md:h-[531px] object-cover"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- View Gallery Button -->
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <button class="bg-e5-red text-white px-10 md:px-16 py-4 md:py-6 text-[18px] md:text-[24px] font-franklin-demi tracking-[2px] md:tracking-[2.4px] uppercase hover:bg-e5-red/90 transition-colors">
            VIEW GALLERY
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
